      </header>
      <div class="grid grid-3" role="list">
        <article class="specialty-card rv" role="listitem">
          <svg class="specialty-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 44v-28a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h36a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M12 44h40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M16 20v24M24 20v24M32 20v24M40 20v24M48 20v24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/></svg>
          <h3>Architectural House Slabs</h3>
          <p>Engineered waffle and raft slabs for architectural homes. Precise set-out, reinforcement scheduling, and finish grades to spec.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="specialty-card rv" role="listitem">
          <svg class="specialty-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 36v-12a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h36a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M8 36h48" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M16 24v12M24 24v12M32 24v12M40 24v12M48 24v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/></svg>
          <h3>Drop Edge Beam Slabs</h3>
          <p>Integrated edge beams for sloping sites and split-level designs. Formed and poured monolithic with the slab for structural continuity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="specialty-card rv" role="listitem">
          <svg class="specialty-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 52v-36a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h36a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><path d="M12 52h40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M16 16v36M24 16v36M32 16v36M40 16v36M48 16v36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/></svg>
          <h3>Concrete Driveways</h3>
          <p>Exposed aggregate, broom finish, and coloured concrete driveways. Sub-base preparation, expansion joints, and drainage falls to council standard.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
