  <section class="section rv" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <span class="section-label">Why local matters</span>
        <h2 id="why-title">Lake Macquarie knowledge, site-level precision</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="why-local rv">
        <h3>One operator, one standard</h3>
        <p>No subcontracting. Every set-out, pour, and finish is executed by the same crew who knows Lake Macquarie ground conditions, council requirements, and the access constraints of Redhead, Charlestown, Belmont, and surrounds. The result is a slab that holds its line — no callbacks, no compromises.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
